ob": 0.007579066790640354}, {"id": 42, "seek": 25892, "start": 264.88, "end": 267.8, "text": " And that's anything new.", "tokens": [50662, 400, 300, 311, 1340, 777, 13, 50808], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1958688399370979, "compression_ratio": 1.538812785388128, "no_speech_prob": 0.007579066790640354}, {"id": 43, "seek": 25892, "start": 267.8, "end": 270.28000000000003, "text": " Anything they haven't experienced before.", "tokens": [50808, 11998, 436, 2378, 380, 6751, 949, 13, 50932], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1958688399370979, "compression_ratio": 1.538812785388128, "no_speech_prob": 0.007579066790640354}, {"id": 44, "seek": 25892, "start": 270.28000000000003, "end": 276.16, "text": " And if you think about it, that's quite sensible for a bird living in the city.", "tokens": [50932, 400, 498, 291, 519, 466, 309, 11, 300, 311, 1596, 25380, 337, 257, 5255, 2647, 294, 264, 2307, 13, 51226], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1958688399370979, "compression_ratio": 1.538812785388128, "no_speech_prob": 0.007579066790640354}, {"id": 45, "seek": 25892, "start": 276.16, "end": 285.40000000000003, "text": " Jonathan Atwell, in Indiana University, is looking at how a range of animals respond", "tokens": [51226, 15471, 1711, 6326, 11, 294, 21858, 3535, 11, 307, 1237, 412, 577, 257, 3613, 295, 4882, 4196, 51688], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1958688399370979, "compression_ratio": 1.538812785388128, "no_speech_prob": 0.007579066790640354}, {"id": 46, "seek": 25892, "start": 285.40000000000003, "end": 287.76, "text": " to urban environments.", "tokens": [51688, 281, 9681, 12388, 13, 51806], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1958688399370979, "compression_ratio": 1.538812785388128, "no_speech_prob": 0.007579066790640354}, {"id": 47, "seek": 28776, "start": 287.76, "end": 292.32, "text": " He's found that when they're under stress, their endocrine systems react by reducing", "tokens": [50364, 634, 311, 1352, 300, 562, 436, 434, 833, 4244, 11, 641, 917, 3617, 533, 3652, 4515, 538, 12245, 50592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11912262958029042, "compression_ratio": 1.504201680672269, "no_speech_prob": 0.08440404385328293}, {"id": 48, "seek": 28776, "start": 292.32, "end": 297.4, "text": " the amount of hormones such as corticosterone into their blood.", "tokens": [50592, 264, 2372, 295, 22453, 1270, 382, 11278, 299, 7096, 546, 666, 641, 3390, 13, 50846], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11912262958029042, "compression_ratio": 1.504201680672269, "no_speech_prob": 0.08440404385328293}, {"id": 49, "seek": 28776, "start": 297.4, "end": 299.84, "text": " It's a sensible seeming adaptation.", "tokens": [50846, 467, 311, 257, 25380, 1643, 278, 21549, 13, 50968], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11912262958029042, "compression_ratio": 1.504201680672269, "no_speech_prob": 0.08440404385328293}, {"id": 50, "seek": 28776, "start": 299.84, "end": 306.28, "text": " A rat that gets scared every time a subway train rolls past won't be very successful.", "tokens": [50968, 316, 5937, 300, 2170, 5338, 633, 565, 257, 24953, 3847, 15767, 1791, 1582, 380, 312, 588, 4406, 13, 51290], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11912262958029042, "compression_ratio": 1.504201680672269, "no_speech_prob": 0.08440404385328293}, {"id": 51, "seek": 28776, "start": 306.28, "end": 313.88, "text": " There's just one more study I'd like to mention, which is by Sarah Parton and her team.", "tokens": [51290, 821, 311, 445, 472, 544, 2979, 286, 1116, 411, 281, 2152, 11, 597, 307, 538, 9519, 4100, 266, 293, 720, 1469, 13, 51670], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11912262958029042, "compression_ratio": 1.504201680672269, "no_speech_prob": 0.08440404385328293}, {"id": 52, "seek": 31388, "start": 313.88, "end": 318.8, "text": " And they've been looking at how squirrels communicate in an urban environment.", "tokens": [50364, 400, 436, 600, 668, 1237, 412, 577, 28565, 82, 7890, 294, 364, 9681, 2823, 13, 50610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1033685399197984, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.48164525628089905}, {"id": 53, "seek": 31388, "start": 318.8, "end": 324.2, "text": " And they've found that a routine part of their communication is carried out by waving", "tokens": [50610, 400, 436, 600, 1352, 300, 257, 9927, 644, 295, 641, 6101, 307, 9094, 484, 538, 35347, 50880], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1033685399197984, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.48164525628089905}, {"id": 54, "seek": 31388, "start": 324.2, "end": 326.28, "text": " their tails.", "tokens": [50880, 641, 28537, 13, 50984], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1033685399197984, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.48164525628089905}, {"id": 55, "seek": 31388, "start": 326.28, "end": 332.0, "text": " You do also see this in the country, but it's much more prevalent in cities, possibly", "tokens": [50984, 509, 360, 611, 536, 341, 294, 264, 1941, 11, 457, 309, 311, 709, 544, 30652, 294, 6486, 11, 6264, 51270], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1033685399197984, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.48164525628089905}, {"id": 56, "seek": 31388, "start": 332.0, "end": 336.4, "text": " because it's effective in a noisy environment.", "tokens": [51270, 570, 309, 311, 4942, 294, 257, 24518, 2823, 13, 51490], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1033685399197984, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.48164525628089905}, {"id": 57, "seek": 31388, "start": 336.4, "end": 340.76, "text": " So what are the long-term implications of this?", "tokens": [51490, 407, 437, 366, 264, 938, 12, 7039, 16602, 295, 341, 30, 51708], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1033685399197984, "compression_ratio": 1.6199095022624435, "no_speech_prob": 0.48164525628089905}, {"id": 58, "seek": 34076, "start": 340.76, "end": 347.15999999999997, "text": " One possibility is that we may see completely new species developing in cities.", "tokens": [50364, 1485, 7959, 307, 300, 321, 815, 536, 2584, 777, 6172, 6416, 294, 6486, 13, 50684], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12859046322175827, "compression_ratio": 1.5515695067264574, "no_speech_prob": 0.6406296491622925}, {"id": 59, "seek": 34076, "start": 347.15999999999997, "end": 353.88, "text": " But on the other hand, it's possible that not all of these adaptations will be permanent.", "tokens": [50684, 583, 322, 264, 661, 1011, 11, 309, 311, 1944, 300, 406, 439, 295, 613, 44465, 486, 312, 10996, 13, 51020], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12859046322175827, "compression_ratio": 1.5515695067264574, "no_speech_prob": 0.6406296491622925}, {"id": 60, "seek": 34076, "start": 353.88, "end": 359.15999999999997, "text": " Once the animal's got accustomed to its new environment, it may no longer need the features", "tokens": [51020, 3443, 264, 5496, 311, 658, 35980, 281, 1080, 777, 2823, 11, 309, 815, 572, 2854, 643, 264, 4122, 51284], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12859046322175827, "compression_ratio": 1.5515695067264574, "no_speech_prob": 0.6406296491622925}, {"id": 61, "seek": 34076, "start": 359.15999999999997, "end": 361.32, "text": " it's developed.", "tokens": [51284, 309, 311, 4743, 13, 51392], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12859046322175827, "compression_ratio": 1.5515695067264574, "no_speech_prob": 0.6406296491622925}, {"id": 62, "seek": 34076, "start": 361.32, "end": 366.76, "text": " So now we've had a look at adaptation.", "tokens": [51392, 407, 586, 321, 600, 632, 257, 574, 412, 21549, 13, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12859046322175827, "compression_ratio": 1.5515695067264574, "no_speech_prob": 0.6406296491622925}, {"id": 63, "seek": 34076, "start": 366.76, "end": 370.24, "text": " That is the end of section 4.", "tokens": [51664, 663, 307, 264, 917, 295, 3541, 1017, 13, 51838], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12859046322175827, "compression_ratio": 1.5515695067264574, "no_speech_prob": 0.6406296491622925}, {"id": 64, "seek": 37024, "start": 370.24, "end": 373.32, "text": " You now have half a minute to check your answers.", "tokens": [50364, 509, 586, 362, 1922, 257, 3456, 281, 1520, 428, 6338, 13, 50518], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.23623553344181605, "compression_ratio": 0.8909090909090909, "no_speech_prob": 0.775314450263977}, {"id": 65, "seek": 40024, "start": 400.40000000000003, "end": 405.12, "text": " That is the end of the listening test.", "tokens": [50372, 663, 307, 264, 917, 295, 264, 4764, 1500, 13, 50608], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3532549540201823, "compression_ratio": 1.2429906542056075, "no_speech_prob": 0.013132758438587189}, {"id": 66, "seek": 40024, "start": 405.12, "end": 412.52, "text": " In the IELTS test, you would now have 10 minutes to transfer your answers to the answer sheet.", "tokens": [50608, 682, 264, 286, 3158, 7327, 1500, 11, 291, 576, 586, 362, 1266, 2077, 281, 5003, 428, 6338, 281, 264, 1867, 8193, 13, 50978], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3532549540201823, "compression_ratio": 1.2429906542056075, "no_speech_prob": 0.013132758438587189}], "language": "en"}